==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[hydrogen]] [[peroxide]]|-}}

# {{context|inorganic compound|lang=en}} A [[colourless]] [[liquid]], H<sub>2</sub>O<sub>2</sub>, soluble in [[water]], used as a mild [[antiseptic]], [[bleaching agent]] (especially for bleaching [[hair]]), [[oxidizing agent]] and [[chemical]] [[reagent]].

